# Logic Learned

## Largest Element

- Assume first element is the largest.
- Compare every element.
- Update the largest value whenever a bigger element is found.

---

## Smallest Element

- Assume first element is the smallest.
- Compare every element.
- Update the smallest value whenever a smaller element is found.

---

## Sum of Array

- Initialize sum = 0.
- Add every element to sum.

---

## Average

Average = Total Sum / Number of Elements

